a. implementation of policies, programs and activities for the fulfillment of Children's rights in efforts to prevent violations of Children's rights in the Region;
b. increasing participation and role of Children's forums or the like;
c. facilitating the strengthening of institutions and resources of government agencies, non-governmental organizations, media and business sectors;
